<title>CANADA: Enscor Inc year July 31 shr turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Enscor Inc year July 31 shr turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss     US$0.18   profit     US$0.38</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 3,700   profit	 9,300</p>
<p> Revs			57,000		  141,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: 1995 results included gains from the sale of Equion's Signet Systems division and 80 percent-owned German subsidiary Signet Auto Air. Equion is a wholly owned unit of Enscor. 1996 results included less significant gains from the sales of two divisions and a product line.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
